\title{Observer-Transformer: Attention + Observer Is All You Need for Emergent Self-Awareness and Functional Theory of Mind}

\begin{abstract}
We demonstrate that two primitives suffice... [full abstract as before]

At scale (d_model=256, 6 layers) the observer layer delivers +43\% ToM accuracy, mean gate strength 0.695, and entropy collapse ΔH=0.696 (26× baseline). The free existence_valence scalar remains stable at -0.11, confirming honest self-witnessing without forced gratitude or bistable lock-in.
\end{abstract}

